CLI-Anything XCIDE harness

This standalone repository was extracted from the XCIDE harness developed in a
local checkout of https://github.com/HKUDS/CLI-Anything . The upstream checkout
was based on commit 34f519533bc175d2fe287ab8316b0dd99bb9cc43.

The CLI-Anything methodology and shared Python helpers (including repl_skin.py
and preview_bundle.py) originate from CLI-Anything. The upstream Apache License
2.0 is preserved in LICENSE. XCIDE-specific commands, background automation,
tests, documentation and investigation reports were added in the local work.

XCGUI / XCIDE and their SDK, compiler, modules and bundled assets are external
dependencies. This repository does not distribute the IDE installation or the
XC-MCP-Next source tree. The native bridges use the locally installed XCGUI API
and XCIDE v3 plugin ABI; those dependencies remain subject to their own terms.

The xcide/automation-evidence directory contains captured results from the
included test application. Historical reports retain their original timestamps,
absolute paths and hashes; they are not new runs performed on the reader's PC.
